  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "第三コロシアム前・噴水広場",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "amara.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-casino-cafe-morning.png",
        "alt": "噴水広場の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.epilogue.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/amara-epilogue-no-verdict-v1.png",
        "alt": "勝敗のない落書きの前で青いチョークを差し出し、笑うアマラ"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.epilogue.asset.still.002",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/amara-epilogue-undecided-chalk-reward-v1.png",
        "alt": "宇宙法廷の天秤を閉じ、勝敗を決めず、折れかけた青いチョークをミミへ差し出すアマラ"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会から二週間。私は精算書類の山と戦っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "アマラさんと会う約束は、していない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "していないので、噴水広場を通る回数が一日三回に増えただけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "通勤経路の最適化、それだけ。異議は認めない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "闘技場の入口に、新しい相談窓口ができていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "看板は手書きで一行。「規則への苦情も、受け付けます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "amara.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "窓口を作るだけで、よく会社が許しましたね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "許可は取っていない。禁止する規則も、まだ見つかっていない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「見つかっていない」の言い方が、完全に確信犯だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "再建された闘技場の新しい第一条は短い。「出場しない自由を、妨げない」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "第二条は休憩時間です。第一条より、長い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "午後、窓口が閉まる。今日アマラさんが出した結論は三件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出さずに「一緒に考える」と決めた相談は、その倍あった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "広場の石畳に、子どもが描いた二匹の怪獣と、どちらにも届かない王冠が残ってた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「どっちの勝ち?」と聞かれ、アマラさんは白い手袋のまま固まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "重力へ判決を出せる人が、子どもの落書きの前で三分も黙ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は助け舟を出さず、噴水の縁から続きを待った。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今日は判決を出さない。勝敗より、続きを見たい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は規則集を閉じ、石畳へ膝をついた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤いチョークで、怪獣二匹の間に耳の長い何かを描き足す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.012c",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.012c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "円は少し歪み、右耳だけが妙に強かった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それ、私ですか?　ずいぶん判例の少ない生き物ですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "被告ではない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "たぶん兎だ。異議があるなら、隣へ描いて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "amara.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "振り向いたアマラさんが、折れかけた青いチョークを差し出して笑った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.015b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.015b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "判決でも命令でもない誘いに、胸だけが先に賛成した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.015c",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.015c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "石畳へ降り、まだ空いてる場所へ線を引いた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "amara.epilogue.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日の落書きに、判決なし。——続きは、次回期日に」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "amara.epilogue.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次回期日は、未定のまま二人で決めることになってる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "amara.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
